{"id":"word:hebrew:H3754","type":"word","title":"כֶּרֶם","subtitle":"H3754 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a garden or vineyard","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to כֶּרֶם (H3754) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 92 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"כֶּרֶם (kerem) means a garden or vineyard First listed occurrence: 1Chr 27 27."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"כֶּרֶם","transliteration":"kerem","pronunciation":"keh'-rem","strong":"H3754","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3754","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["כְרָמִ֔ים","כְּרָמִ֥ים","כֶּ֥רֶם","כֶּ֖רֶם","כַּרְמִֽ/י"],"morphs":[["HNcbpa",17],["HNcbsa",12],["HNcbsc",7],["HNcbsc/Sp2ms",6],["HNcbsc/Sp1cs",5],["HC/Ncbpa",5],["HTd/Ncbpa",4],["HC/Ncbsa",4],["HC/Ncbpc/Sp1cp",4],["HTd/Ncbsa",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"a garden or vineyard","usage":"vines, (increase of the) vineyard(-s), vintage. See also 1021 .","full":"H3754. kerem כֶּרֶם 92 noun masculine Deut 28:30 ( feminine Isa 27:2 ) vineyard (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic כַּרְמָא Zinjirli כרם DHM Sendsch.58 ; Arabic , vine ; Ethiopic vine ; Jen ZA vii. (1892), 217 compare Assyrian Karânu , vine ; — etymology dubious; Thes and others compare Arabic noble, Generous, fertile , but precarious); — absolute ׳כ Exod 22:4 +, כָּ֑רֶם Gen 9:20 +; construct כֶּרֶם 1Kin 21:7 +; suffix כַּרְמִי Isa 5:3 +, כַּרְמְךָ Exod 23:11 +, etc.; plural כְּרָמִים Josh 24:13 +; construct כַּרְמֵי Amos 5:1-2 t.; suffix כְּרָמֵנוּ Neh 5:3 3 t.; כַרְמֵיכֶם Amos 4:9 2 t., etc., — vineyard Gen 9:20 (J), 1Kin 21:1 9 t. 1 Kings 21; Song 2:15 (twice in verse) +; so even Judg 15:5 (where read ׳כָ וזית compare GFM, who however doubts Genuineness); + זַּיִת Exod 23:11 (E) and often (V. זית ); + שָׂדֶה 22:4 ; 22:5 (E), and often; figurative of Israel under ׳י s. care Isa 5:1 ff., compare 3:14 ; Jer 12:10 ; figurative of Shulamite's complexion Song 1:6 , of her heart 8:12 . &#8212; Vbs. governing ׳כ are: — נָטַע Gen 9:20 ; Amos 5:11 16 t., compare כ ׳מַטָּעֵי Micah 1:6 ; זָרַע Deut 22:9 (c. 2 accusative); חִלֵּל = begin to use fruit of , 20:6 (twice in verse); 28:30 ; Jer 31:5 ; זָמַר prune , Lev 25:3-4 , בָּצַר gather, harvest (literally cut off , i.e. grapes, 25:5 , 11 ), Deut 24:21 ; Judg 9:27 , compare לִקֵּשׁ Job 24:6 ; עוֺלֵל glean , Lev 19:10 ; Deut 24:21 ; אָכַל Josh 24:13 (usually 'eat fruit of' Isa 65:21 , etc.); locusts devour Amos 4:9 (si vera lectio) On proper name, of a location כְּרָמִים אָבֵל see II. אָבֵל 4 ; הַכֶּרֶם בֵּית .","rootNote":"from an unused root of uncertain meaning;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 27 27","keyReferences":["1Chr 27 27","1Chr 27 27","1Kgs 21 1","1Kgs 21 2","1Kgs 21 2","1Kgs 21 6","1Kgs 21 6","1Kgs 21 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":92,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 27 27","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ֨/כְּרָמִ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 27","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֶׁ/בַּ/כְּרָמִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTr/Rd/Ncbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כֶּ֧רֶם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּרְמְ/ךָ֜","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 2","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כֶּ֖רֶם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כַּרְמְ/ךָ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כֶ֖רֶם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"